apple_hup.roblox | Murder Mystery 2 | V1.0.0 (2026-10-09)
Single-file client panel, 5 categories / 20 features, Thai + English.
Run this entire file in a compatible Roblox client Lua environment.
Roblox Studio: use a LocalScript in StarterPlayerScripts and set image asset IDs.
Original attached images are embedded; they require writefile + getcustomasset
(or getsynasset). No external script downloads or game remotes are used.
Kanit: Roblox font family 12187373592. English temporarily uses BuilderSans:
the requested name "bumbi" could not be identified; set EN_FONT_FAMILY below.
Client changes can be reset or restricted by the game. Role labels describe
currently replicated Knife/Gun tools, not authoritative round roles.
V1 is not live-tested in MM2. Diagnostics expose capability/asset status.
RightShift or floating A button: show/hide. X: unload and restore changes.
Saved profiles contain display preferences only; gameplay toggles start OFF.

FEATURES: 01 release notes, 02 Discord link, 03 role guide, 04 diagnostics,
05 walk speed, 06 jump height, 07 air jump, 08 noclip, 09 player outlines,
10 name/role/distance labels, 11 dropped-gun marker, 12 bright view,
13 FOV, 14 crosshair, 15 spectate, 16 zoom range, 17 language,
18 panel scale, 19 display profiles, 20 reset all.
]]

